  "rationale": "Tail ~30uA, stage-2 ~45uA (under 100uA). gm1~0.4mS with Cc=2p gives GBW well above 3MHz; wide M6 (gm~0.9mS) pushes p2 past 25MHz for 60deg PM; Rz~1/gm6 nulls RHP zero; L=1u devices for 70dB two-stage gain."
